ly with the corresponding instance-specific prompt ( Case 4 ). This choice is intended to better localize the instance-specific prompts within the reference image given as context. Finally, we keep the attention from the context tokens to the latent and context tokens unbiased ( Case 5 ) to favor layout, colors, and style preservation in the final image.
